 <hola@pablodorado.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:00:51 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] perf(merkle): the empty-subtree chain as a static table

build_empty_chain() hashed 128 times on every root, proof, batch proof
and state-root computation, and returned the 4 KiB chain by value: in
aledgent's core, 14 rebuilds a reservation, 21% of its hashes. The chain
is a constant of the tree's definition, so it is now SMT_EMPTY_CHAIN, a
static table borrowed by every caller. build_empty_chain() keeps its
signature and returns a copy; compute_empty_chain() is the recurrence, and
a test holds the table to it. Roots and proofs are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/merkle.rs     | 298 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/state_root.rs |   6 +-
 2 files changed, 292 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

